#
# The one place the CI's PostgreSQL images are pinned. Each value is the digest of the upstream
# multi-architecture image, and, because the mirror copies it byte for byte, the digest of
# ghcr.io/bloque-app/bezent-ci-postgres:<tag> as well.
#
# Read by .github/actions/ci-postgres (what jobs pull) and by .github/workflows/mirror-ci-images.yml
# (what is copied to GHCR). Jobs never pull these anonymously from Docker Hub or ECR Public, which
# rate-limit the shared runner addresses.
#
# To bump: take the new digest with `crane digest docker.io/library/postgres:<tag>`, change it
# here, merge, then run the "Mirror CI images" workflow (Actions tab, Run workflow) on main. Until
# it has run, jobs fall back to the upstream registry by the same digest.
BEZENT_CI_POSTGRES_16=sha256:9e2cf6287f25c3151f4c9421ccce2b17f3e60061c111a29165e0d2cdd9ff0a97
BEZENT_CI_POSTGRES_18_ALPINE=sha256:83148c0bc09eac4d598b70a61e1404d0212b76c95c504bfd6c81a4c59ec91792
